{"3421100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "War and Politics", "steam_appid": 3421100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421100/extras/9dcc4af47d2f69ac452eb85bd868b7b7.avif?t=1787449251\" width=1560 height=326 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of President (or Prime Minister) and manage the government, policy, taxes, military, and diplomacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer voters' questions about key debated policies and engage with voters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demonstrate leadership to protect the nation from crises such as war, nuclear threats, terrorism, and pandemics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The goal is to win the election and continue your journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2000 Mode and 2025 Mode reflecting real economic indicators and international affairs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose playback speed from real-time (X1) up to X16,384 to suit your preference</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Government</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421100/extras/2271ce3b6f41afdbe61cc0fa54755c21.poster.avif?t=1787449251\" width=800 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421100/extras/2271ce3b6f41afdbe61cc0fa54755c21.webm?t=1787449251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421100/extras/2271ce3b6f41afdbe61cc0fa54755c21.mp4?t=1787449251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase or decrease the budget of government departments, establish or abolish government departments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Policies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421100/extras/fcecb3f78ddf95a2a086d275075173d2.poster.avif?t=1787449251\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421100/extras/fcecb3f78ddf95a2a086d275075173d2.webm?t=1787449251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421100/extras/fcecb3f78ddf95a2a086d275075173d2.mp4?t=1787449251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Implement or abolish major policies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foreign policy, economy, welfare, criminal law, constitution, treaties, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >National specificities: The U.S. (three-term limit), Japan (pacifist constitution (renouncing war)), etc., can be amended or maintained.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Taxes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421100/extras/3651fa4cc837be0d45c54fed2cc1a82c.poster.avif?t=1787449251\" width=800 height=44 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421100/extras/3651fa4cc837be0d45c54fed2cc1a82c.webm?t=1787449251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421100/extras/3651fa4cc837be0d45c54fed2cc1a82c.mp4?t=1787449251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>  </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise or lower major taxes, introduce or abolish tax systems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Triggers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide as a leader on triggers (events) that occur based on algorithms. (ON/OFF)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Triggers inspired by real events – What would you do if you were the decision-maker?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Military</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen or reduce military power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diplomacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Negotiate with other nations or deploy spies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form alliances and win the war.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nuclear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire or dismantle nuclear weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve victory in nuclear conflicts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Elections</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain public support and win the election.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate or delay the election cycle, hold or abolish elections.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat Conditions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Election defeat (elections can be abolished)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat in war (except on Normal difficulty)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bankruptcy (If international organizations do not provide a bailout)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assassination (ON/OFF)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Options</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provides detailed options such as theme changes (color, quality), speed adjustment (real-time to X16384), font size adjustment, trigger ON/OFF, and auto-war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fullscreen/Windowed mode: F4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Default key: Arrow Keys, Enter, Esc, Mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keybinding support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your beliefs into reality.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421100/extras/9dcc4af47d2f69ac452eb85bd868b7b7.avif?t=1787449251\" width=1560 height=326 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of President (or Prime Minister) and manage the government, policy, taxes, military, and diplomacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer voters' questions about key debated policies and engage with voters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demonstrate leadership to protect the nation from crises such as war, nuclear threats, terrorism, and pandemics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The goal is to win the election and continue your journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2000 Mode and 2025 Mode reflecting real economic indicators and international affairs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose playback speed from real-time (X1) up to X16,384 to suit your preference</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Government</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421100/extras/2271ce3b6f41afdbe61cc0fa54755c21.poster.avif?t=1787449251\" width=800 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421100/extras/2271ce3b6f41afdbe61cc0fa54755c21.webm?t=1787449251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421100/extras/2271ce3b6f41afdbe61cc0fa54755c21.mp4?t=1787449251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase or decrease the budget of government departments, establish or abolish government departments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Policies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421100/extras/fcecb3f78ddf95a2a086d275075173d2.poster.avif?t=1787449251\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421100/extras/fcecb3f78ddf95a2a086d275075173d2.webm?t=1787449251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst